{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的音乐细节描写和情绪转折的微观层次明显不如 X，尤其缺少对具体音型、力度变化、旋律走向和瞬间心理反应的细致捕捉。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边看的普通观众，Y 的左右分栏让故事叙述和音乐感受各有位置，左侧用完整、自然的语言交代人物处境、动机和心理变化，右侧短词帮助迅速捕捉音乐反应，不必自己拼接大量零散信息。尤其是 S05—S12，人物从不服气、怀念、孤独、动摇到接受矛盾并决定继续生活的过程，Y 的因果关系和前后衔接更容易跟住。X 的优势是音乐描写更细腻、更有瞬间感，但信息密度和碎片化程度较高，整体更像丰富的音乐观察笔记，而不是普通观众能轻松跟随的人物故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "de370ffa-4385-427e-b909-cbefa8500d4e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T201155154998Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.671, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:12:32.844617+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "42fd00d92d5d573f02227f1c53ffb44a48ec561a09a423bc6668747bca835f83", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc